      "max_chars": 24,
      "source_sample_chars": 11,
      "source_text": "述职汇报｜个人职业规划",
      "bounds_pt": [
        35.7,
        23.7,
        823.9,
        36.4
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_27",
      "shape_id": 27,
      "shape_name": "文本框 26",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 78,
      "source_sample_chars": 39,
      "source_text": "通过参加培训，提升自己在核心领域的技能，尤其是与行业发展相关的新技术、新方法。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        54.0,
        208.4,
        153.4,
        60.1
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_28",
      "shape_id": 28,
      "shape_name": "文本框 27",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 78,
      "source_sample_chars": 39,
      "source_text": "在接下来的两年内，建立起更广泛的职业网络，增加与行业领袖及同业同行的互动机会。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        229.2,
        208.4,
        153.4,
        60.1
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_29",
      "shape_id": 29,
      "shape_name": "文本框 28",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 64,
      "source_sample_chars": 32,
      "source_text": "在未来三年内，争取晋升为团队负责人或项目经理，提升团队管理能力。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        403.8,
        208.4,
        153.4,
        60.1
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_30",
      "shape_id": 30,
      "shape_name": "文本框 29",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 68,
      "source_sample_chars": 34,
      "source_text": "通过优化工作流程，合理分配时间，提高工作效率，更好地平衡工作与生活。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        579.0,
        208.4,
        153.4,
        60.1
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_31",
      "shape_id": 31,
      "shape_name": "文本框 30",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 82,
      "source_sample_chars": 41,
      "source_text": "在未来五年内，发展至少一项与当前领域相关但有所不同的跨领域能力，拓宽职业发展路径。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        753.0,
        208.4,
        153.4,
        60.1
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_32",
      "shape_id": 32,
      "shape_name": "文本框 31",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 80,
      "source_sample_chars": 40,
      "source_text": "选定并报读至少两门在线课程或线下培训。\n完成相关证书认证，提升专业资格和竞争力。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        54.0,
        345.9,
        153.4,
        88.4
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_33",
      "shape_id": 33,
      "shape_name": "文本框 32",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 82,
      "source_sample_chars": 41,
      "source_text": "每年参加两到三次行业内的研讨会、峰会或论坛。\n扩大社交网络，参与行业相关话题讨论。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        229.2,
        345.9,
        153.4,
        88.4
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_34",
      "shape_id": 34,
      "shape_name": "文本框 33",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 86,
      "source_sample_chars": 43,
      "source_text": "参与更多的跨部门项目，锻炼协调和管理能力。\n参加决策力课程，提升自己的思维、决策能力。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        403.8,
        345.9,
        153.4,
        88.4
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_35",
      "shape_id": 35,
      "shape_name": "文本框 34",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 84,
      "source_sample_chars": 42,
      "source_text": "每周制定具体的工作目标，确保有清晰的优先级。\n优化工作流程，定期审视自己的工作流程。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        579.0,
        345.9,
        153.4,
        88.4
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_36",
      "shape_id": 36,
      "shape_name": "文本框 35",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 98,
      "source_sample_chars": 49,
      "source_text": "学习相关领域知识，拓展思维框架和解决问题的方法。\n与不同部门进行合作，培养跨领域的理解和协作能力。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        753.0,
